  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "310 Grande Pointe by Oversee 30A | Perfect in Walton County Awards – Three-Time Diamond Winner – Best Rental Mgmt. 2026, 2025, 2024<br> <br>Welcome to your happy place in Inlet Beach! Just a 15-minute stroll from the sand, this stylish, sun-filled home is packed with everything you need for a laid-back, memory-making getaway.<br><br>Highlights:<br>📍 Inlet Beach<br>👣 15-minute walk to beach<br>👙 Steps to seasonally heated community pool <br>🛌 3 bedrooms, 2.5 baths, sleeps 10<br>🪞 Gorgeous interiors<br>🚲 3 bikes<br>🦞 5-minute drive to Rosemary Beach and Alys Beach<br>🛍️ Dining and shopping at 30Avenue<br> <br>Start your morning with coffee on one of two breezy decks, spend the afternoon floating in the shared pool, or grab a kayak and explore Lake Powell from the nearby dock. Explore 30Avenue, an upscale dining and shopping hub. The 3 bikes make it a breeze. <br><br>Inside, brand-new furnishings and an airy, open layout make it easy to kick back and relax. The living area is made for movie nights, with a comfy sleeper sofa, cozy armchairs, and a 42-inch cable TV. The sleek kitchen is fully stocked with stainless steel appliances, because beach days are better with pancakes. The dining area? Perfect for sharing stories, seafood feasts, and second helpings.<br><br>When it’s time to recharge, the primary suite is a dream with a king bed, en suite bath with a vanity and walk-in shower. The private balcony is built for stargazing. Relax and enjoy the coastal breeze on the front or back. With one king-size bed, one queen-size bed, one full bed, three twin bunks, and a sleeper sofa, there’s room for 10 guests and even your pup. Yep, we’re pet-friendly!<br><br>As a guest of Grande Pointe, you’ll have access to a year-round seasonally heated pool, a dock on Lake Powell, and a pavilion with an entertainment space and full kitchen. Extras like beach gear, complimentary WiFi, a washer/dryer, and parking for two cars make your stay even sweeter.<br><br>With Rosemary Beach and Panama City Beach just minutes away, you’re in the perfect spot for dining, shopping, and outdoor adventures. Book now and get ready for the beach escape you deserve! The Inlet Beach Underpass is designed for pedestrian and cyclist safety at the intersection of Highway 98 and 30A and it provides a safe crossing beneath busy traffic, connecting beach access, shops and restaurants. It includes art murals by local artists.<br><br>At Oversee 30A, we’re here to make your vacation effortless. Our local team is available seven days a week, with a 24/7 emergency line for anything you need.<br><br>Overview:<br>- 3 bedrooms, 2.5 baths<br>- 1,705 square feet<br>- Wi-Fi<br>- 3 bikes included<br>- Streaming only on smart TVs, no cable<br>- Steps to seasonally heated community pool<br><br>Overnight:<br>FIRST FLOOR<br>- Living room pull-out couch, queen-size mattress, Smart TV<br>SECOND FLOOR<br>- Primary Bedroom: King bed, private bath, Smart TV<br>- Guest Room: Queen bed, shared bath, Smart TV<br>- Guest Room: Full over twin bunk and twin over twin bunk, shared bath<br><br>Check-in is 4:00 PM CST. Checkout is 10:00 AM CST.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
