        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Jul 29, 2024",
            "id": "92972f26-acef-4d46-b3c7-68fbf9a8a713",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hi Dean, thank you for sharing your experience at our property 310 Grande Pointe. We are thrilled to hear that you were treated well by Oversee and we truly hope to have you stay with us again!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We stayed in the area before where we were a walking distance from inlet beach, rosemary beach and all the shops and restaurants, this property although nice but the neighborhood is outside the 30A corridor and you’ll need to drive to get there or anywhere in that matter. \nI recommend the company as they have a large portfolio of properties to choose from.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Nice property just far from the town",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Elizabeth H.",
        "date": "2024-04-24T14:39:34Z",
        "id": "662919a6a5731c5002a0b616",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "es_ES",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Apr 25, 2024",
            "id": "47801730-b7d4-4ccf-bd84-fe579c13b03d",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hi Elizabeth, thank you for sharing your experience at our property 310 Grande Pointe. We are so glad you and your family loved your stay. Sounds like you guys did a lot of great cooking! The issue with the grill has been handled and we no longer have that on the property listing as of right now. We appreciate you and hope to have you and your family stay with Oversee!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "My family joined up for vacation at this lovely house, and we loved it! It was equipped with and especially nice kitchen so we did not have to leave for all our meals. We enjoyed having the bikes, as well, so we could ride to the beach and take advantage of the beautiful scenery. My only comment that is not positive is that there was supposed to be a grill, and when we got all our food prepped for barbecue, we realized there wasn't one. We walked to the pool area thinking maybe that is where it was, but there was no grill there, either. The property managers did offer to deduct the inconvenience from our bill, so that was really nice. This was a perfect place to reconnect on a family vacation!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Great Family House",
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
